ll,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"The Aboriginal Signature Estrangin gallery is one of the most important contemporary Aboriginal art galleries in Europe, whose approach is unique with 7 curatorial exhibitions per year in Brussels in its 250 m2 space, located in the basilica district of Koekelberg. The gallery represents more than 100 of Australia's most significant indigenous artists to the younger generation, and is committed to an ethical approach of partnership with them and the 35 art centers and artistic communities in the most remote deserts from the north to the south of this continent. Each year, the director of the gallery goes to the aboriginal territories to prepare the exhibitions with the artists and to select the works in situ. This artistic movement launched around 1971 in Papunya is part of a millennial dynamic of transmission of knowledge, of celebration of sacred places, with a pictorial expression between tradition and innovation. It is becoming increasingly important in the art world, with private collectors and prestigious collections from the largest institutions in Europe, the USA and Australia. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"La galerie Aboriginal Signature Estrangin est une des plus importantes galeries d\u2019art Aborig\u00e8ne contemporain en Europe, dont la d\u00e9marche est unique avec 7 expositions curatoriales par an \u00e0 Bruxelles dans son espace de 250 m2, situ\u00e9 dans le quartier de la basilique de Koekelberg. Elle repr\u00e9sente plus de 100 artistes indig\u00e8nes des plus significatifs d\u2019Australie \u00e0 la jeune g\u00e9n\u00e9ration, et est engag\u00e9e dans une d\u00e9marche \u00e9thique de partenariat avec eux et les 35 centres d\u2019art et communaut\u00e9s artistiques dans les d\u00e9serts les plus \u00e9loign\u00e9s du nord au sud de ce continent. Chaque ann\u00e9e le directeur de la galerie  se rend dans les territoires aborig\u00e8nes pour pr\u00e9parer les expositions avec les artistes et s\u00e9lectionner in-situ les \u0153uvres. Ce mouvement artistique lanc\u00e9 autour de 1971 \u00e0 Papunya s\u2019inscrit dans une dynamique mill\u00e9naire de transmission du savoir, de c\u00e9l\u00e9bration des lieux sacr\u00e9s, avec une expression picturale entre tradition et innovation. Il prend une amplitude de plus en plus importante dans le monde de l\u2019art, aupr\u00e8s des collectionneurs priv\u00e9s et des prestigieuses collections des plus grandes institutions en Europe, aux USA et en Australie.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Aboriginal ","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature - Estrangin Fine art","address_street_name":"Rue Jules Besme","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Rue Jules Besme, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin Gallery","address_street_name":"Jules Besmestraat","address_street_number":"101","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@aboriginalsignature.com","website":"http:\/\/www.aboriginalsignature.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 55 08 54","phone_booking":"+32 475 55 08 54","address_zip":"1081","address_city":"Koekelberg","address_line1":"Jules Besmestraat, 101","address_line2":"1081 Koekelberg","description_web":"Aboriginal Signature Estrangin is een van Europa's meest toonaangevende hedendaagse Aboriginal kunstgalerijen. De aanpak is uniek: er worden 7 tentoonstellingen per jaar gecureerd in de 250m2 grote galerie (gelegen in de buurt van de Basiliek van Koekelberg). Ze vertegenwoordigt meer dan 100 autochtone kunstenaars, zowel gevestigd als opkomend talent, in een ethisch  partnerschap met hen en de 35 kunstcentra en gemeenschappen in de meest afgelegen van het Australisch continent. Elk jaar reist de directeur van de galerie naar de Aboriginalgebieden om samen met de kunstenaars tentoonstellingen voor te bereiden en ter plaatse werken te selecteren. Deze artistieke beweging, die rond 1971 in Papunya ontstond, maakt deel uit van een eeuwenoude dynamiek van kennisoverdracht en viering van heilige plaatsen, met een picturale expressie die traditie en vernieuwing combineert. Een beweging die aan belang wint in de kunstwereld, bij particuliere verzamelaars en in prestigieuze collecties van de grootste instellingen in Europa, de VS en Australi\u00eb.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[23],"translations":{"de":["Westen"],"pt":[null],"en":["West"],"it":["Ovest"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Ouest"],"sp":["Oeste"],"nl":["West"]}},"neca":"gallery","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":19735,"location":{"lat":50.86244313,"lon":4.32072232},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2014-12-04T20:45:31+01:00","id":25973