00e9senter l\u2019exposition collective \"\u00catre-Vivant.e\", fruit de sa formation l\u2019Art-en-Actes. Du 25 mai au 1er juillet 2024, venez d\u00e9couvrir les cr\u00e9ations des \u00e9tudiantes-artistes \u00e0 la Maison Commune.\n\nAvec l'accompagnement et sous la curation d\u2019Eli Desnot Marsan, les artistes explorent les th\u00e8mes de la sensorialit\u00e9, la corporalit\u00e9, l\u2019environnement, la sociologie et l\u2019engagement \u00e0 travers leurs pratiques plurielles. L\u2019exposition c\u00e9l\u00e8bre le mutualisme int\u00e9gral, o\u00f9 chaque \u0153uvre s\u2019enrichit des \u00e9changes et collaborations entre artistes.\n\nAvec la participation de :\nNarguess Azimi\nChahrazad Amhajer\nLauren Bagnis\nDoroth\u00e9e Demoulin\nAmrita Depraz\nMichel Dieudonn\u00e9\u00a0\nKatiuska Landaeta\nKristell Leclercq\nEleonora Martinello\nSoumiya Mommen\nEli Desnot Marsan\nIhsane Rahmouni\nAhmed Ben Taleb\nDalia Zoch","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/culturesetpublics.be\/","email":"rosanna.graceffa@culturesetpublics.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010850"},"sp":{"name":"\"\u00catre Vivant\u00b7e\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/culturesetpublics.be\/","email":"rosanna.graceffa@culturesetpublics.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010850"},"nl":{"name":"\"\u00catre Vivant\u00b7e\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/culturesetpublics.be\/","email":"rosanna.graceffa@culturesetpublics.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010850"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2023-02-20T16:36:09+01:00","published_at":"2021-02-24T11:15:17+01:00","id":276309,"translations":{