e project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou d