5-30","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-05-27T02:00:41+02:00","published_at":"2024-05-10T15:48:01+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":300067,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.32548726473766765,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[46,36],"translations":{"de":["Multidisziplin\u00e4r","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Multidisciplinary","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Multidisciplinare","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Pluridisciplinaire","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Multidisciplinar","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Multidisciplinair","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', for kids too!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"pt":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', for kids too!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"en":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', for kids too!","shortdescr":"Come and discover Louidgi Beltrame's exhibition 'La huaca llora' with children, thanks to an activity kit available for free at the entrance of the art centre. \n\nVisit our website to find out about the dates and to take part in the weekend of activities, Happy Sunday. ","longdescr":"Since 2012, Louidgi Beltrame has been conducting research in Peru which has led him to investigate the Nazca geoglyphs and film the practice of Jos\u00e9 Levis Pic\u00f3n Saguma, a curandero (traditional healer or shaman). Through films, photographs, ink drawings on canvas, and a sculpture produced for his exhibition at La Loge, the artist explores the liminal figure of the huaquero ('clandestine grave digger'). By maintaining links with the past, huaquer\u00eda\u2014or clandestine excavation\u2014could be seen as a form of resistance to colonisation and a forced, rational interpretation of the world. Here, traditions, spirits, and ancestors are kept alive by owing to transactional gestures and the transmission of knowledge. The exhibition at La Loge is presented in partnership with le Centre d\u2019art contemporain d\u2019Ivry \u2014 le Cr\u00e9dac. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"it":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', for kids too!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"cn":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', for kids too!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"fr":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', aussi pour les enfants!","shortdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir l'exposition 'La huaca llora' de Louidgi Beltrame avec des enfants gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 un kit d'activit\u00e9s disponible gratuitement \u00e0 l'entr\u00e9e du centre d'art. \n\nConsultez notre site internet pour conna\u00eetre les dates et participer au weekend d'activit\u00e9s, Happy Sunday. ","longdescr":"Depuis 2012, Louidgi Beltrame d\u00e9veloppe une recherche au P\u00e9rou, laquelle l\u2019a men\u00e9 \u00e0 exp\u00e9rimenter les g\u00e9oglyphes de Nazca, ou \u00e0 filmer la pratique du curandero (gu\u00e9risseur traditionnel ou chamane) Jos\u00e9 Levis Pic\u00f3n Saguma. \u00c0 travers des films, des photos, des encres sur toile et une sculpture, produits pour l\u2019exposition pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e \u00e0 La Loge, l\u2019artiste s\u2019int\u00e9resse \u00e0 la figure liminale du huaquero (\u00ab fouilleur de tombes clandestin \u00bb). La huaquer\u00eda \u2014 c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire la fouille clandestine \u2014 pourrait \u00eatre per\u00e7ue comme une forme de r\u00e9sistance \u00e0 la colonisation et \u00e0 l\u2019imposition d\u2019une lecture rationnelle du monde, en permettant d\u2019assurer des liens avec le pass\u00e9. Ici, entre les gestes de transactions et les transmissions de savoirs, traditions, esprits et anc\u00eatres demeurent vivant\u00b7es.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"sp":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', for kids too!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"},"nl":{"name":"Louidgi Beltrame - 'La huaca llora', ook voor kinderen!","shortdescr":"Kom de tentoonstelling 'La huaca llora' door Louidgi Beltrame ontdekken met kinderen, dankzij een activiteitenpakket dat gratis verkrijgbaar is bij de ingang van het kunstcentrum. \n\nBezoek onze website voor meer informatie over de data en om deel te nemen aan het weekend vol activiteiten, Happy Sunday. ","longdescr":"Sinds 2012 doet Louidgi Beltrame onderzoek in Peru. Zo onderzocht hij de geogliefen van Nazca en filmde hij de praktijk van de curandero (traditionele genezer of sjamaan) Jos\u00e9 Levis Pic\u00f3n Saguma. De tentoonstelling in La Loge richt zich aan de hand van films, foto's, inktwerken op doek en een sculptuur, op de liminale figuur van de huaquero, een persoon die illegale opgravingen uitvoert op precolumbiaanse vindplaatsen. Huaquer\u00eda \u2013 of clandestiene opgraving \u2013 kan worden gezien als een vorm van verzet tegen de kolonisatie en tegen het opdringen van een rationele kijk op de wereld , omdat het de banden met het verleden behoudt. Hierdoor blijven tradities, geesten en voorouders levend, te midden van het uitvoeren van transacties en het overdragen van kennis.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","email":"info@la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010564"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:46+02:00","id":238201,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Loge ist ein Ort, der sich der zeitgen\u00f6ssischen Kunst, der Architektur und der Theori widmet und von dem Architekten Philippe Rotthier gegr\u00fcndet wurde. Ziel ist die Ausarbeitung einer hochwertigen Programmgestaltung mit konkreten und kritischen Projekten, die angesichts des gegenw\u00e4rtigen kulturellen Kontexts von Belang sind. Architekten, K\u00fcnstler, Ausstellungskommissare und kulturelle Akteure sind eingeladen, ihre Vorschl\u00e4ge und die spezifischen Aspekte aus ihrer Arbeit einzubringen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Loge is a Brussels-based space dedicated to contemporary art, architecture and theory founded by architect Philippe Rotthier. Its aim is to develop a high-quality program that plays a critical role in today\u2019s cultural conversations through specific and precise projects. Architects, artists, curators and cultural agents are invited to develop propositions in which they seek out the characteristic and the peculiar within their practices.\r\nLa Loge is a space where ideas, discussion and presentation coexist. Public formats vary depending on the project; from exhibitions, symposiums, screenings, lectures, and performances to events\u2019 series. Its identity is drawn from the architectural gem that houses it, as well as from the commitment and concerns of its founders. La Loge values engagement of thought and feels particularly interested in exploring questions of space, habitat and use. The small-scale format of La Loge contributes to a context where intimate and direct conversations with its audience and the diversity of protagonists it invites can be initiated and sustained.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"LOGE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Loge est un espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019art contemporain, l\u2019architecture et la th\u00e9orie, initi\u00e9e par l\u2019architecte Philippe Rotthier. Son objectif est de d\u00e9velopper une programmation de qualit\u00e9 \u00e0 travers des projets pr\u00e9cis et critiques, qui font sens au sein des enjeux culturels actuels. Architectes, artistes, commissaires d\u2019expositions et acteurs culturels sont invit\u00e9s \u00e0 y articuler des propositions qui explorent les aspects sp\u00e9cifiques de leur pratique.\r\nLa Loge est un lieu o\u00f9 coexistent les id\u00e9es, la discussion et la pr\u00e9sentation.\r\nChaque projet est d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 selon une formule de pr\u00e9sentation qui lui est propre, allant de l\u2019exposition au s\u00e9minaire, de la projection \u00e0 la conf\u00e9rence, de la performance \u00e0 la s\u00e9rie d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements.\r\nLa Loge puise son identit\u00e9 dans le joyau architectural qui l\u2019abrite ainsi que dans l\u2019engagement et les pr\u00e9occupations de ses fondateurs. La Loge valorise une pens\u00e9e engag\u00e9e et s\u2019int\u00e9resse en particulier \u00e0 des -questions d\u2019espace, d\u2019habitat et d\u2019usage. La structure d\u2019envergure relativement r\u00e9duite de La Loge g\u00e9n\u00e8re un contexte qui permet d\u2019engager et de poursuivre un dialogue direct et intime, tant avec son public qu\u2019avec la diversit\u00e9 d\u2019intervenants qui y sont invit\u00e9s.\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"LOGE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat, 86","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"La Loge is een Brusselse ruimte opgericht door architect Philippe Rotthier en gewijd aan hedendaagse kunst, architectuur en theorie. Het doel is een hoogwaardig programma te ontwikkelen dat een cruciale rol speelt in het hedendaagse culturele debat door middel van concrete en punctuele projecten. Architecten, kunstenaars, curatoren en andere culturele spelers  worden uitgenodigd om voorstellen in te dienen waarin ze op zoek gaan naar het karakteristieke en bijzondere in hun praktijk.\r\nLa Loge is een ruimte waar idee\u00ebn, dialoog en presentatie samengaan. Publieksformaten vari\u00ebren afhankelijk van het project. Dat kan gaan van tentoonstellingen, symposia, filmprojecties, lezingen tot performances of een evenementenreeks. De identiteit van La Loge is geankerd in het architectonisch juweeltje waarin het is  gevestigd maar ook in de toewijding en interesses van de oprichters. La Loge waardeert intellectueel engagement en is in het bijzonder ge\u00efnteresseerd in de verkenning van vragen rond ruimte, habitat en gebruik.\r\nDe kleinschalige vorm van La Loge draagt bij tot een context waarin er plaats is voor intieme, directe gesprekken tussen het publiek en erg diverse gesprekspartners.\r\n \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"LOGE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[5],"translations":{"de":["Flagey"],"pt":[null],"en":["Flagey"],"it":["Flagey"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Flagey"],"sp":["Flagey"],"nl":["Flagey"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1942,"location":{"lat":50.82845961,"lon":4.36564707},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:14:46+02:00","id":238201,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Loge ist ein Ort, der sich der zeitgen\u00f6ssischen Kunst, der Architektur und der Theori widmet und von dem Architekten Philippe Rotthier gegr\u00fcndet wurde. Ziel ist die Ausarbeitung einer hochwertigen Programmgestaltung mit konkreten und kritischen Projekten, die angesichts des gegenw\u00e4rtigen kulturellen Kontexts von Belang sind. Architekten, K\u00fcnstler, Ausstellungskommissare und kulturelle Akteure sind eingeladen, ihre Vorschl\u00e4ge und die spezifischen Aspekte aus ihrer Arbeit einzubringen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Loge is a Brussels-based space dedicated to contemporary art, architecture and theory founded by architect Philippe Rotthier. Its aim is to develop a high-quality program that plays a critical role in today\u2019s cultural conversations through specific and precise projects. Architects, artists, curators and cultural agents are invited to develop propositions in which they seek out the characteristic and the peculiar within their practices.\r\nLa Loge is a space where ideas, discussion and presentation coexist. Public formats vary depending on the project; from exhibitions, symposiums, screenings, lectures, and performances to events\u2019 series. Its identity is drawn from the architectural gem that houses it, as well as from the commitment and concerns of its founders. La Loge values engagement of thought and feels particularly interested in exploring questions of space, habitat and use. The small-scale format of La Loge contributes to a context where intimate and direct conversations with its audience and the diversity of protagonists it invites can be initiated and sustained.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"LOGE","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Loge","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":"86","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@la-loge.be","website":"http:\/\/www.la-loge.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 644 42 48","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage, 86","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_o