"it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/fr\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"pt":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/fr\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"en":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":"DAVE, the interpreter of timeless hits like \"Vanina,\" \"Du c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez Swann,\" and \"Mon c\u0153ur est malade,\" will be back on stage to sing his greatest hits at the Cirque Royal in Brussels on May 31, 2024.","longdescr":"There's the man \u2013 popular, recreational, a connoisseur, spontaneous, with a smile attached to his Dutch accent and explosive good humor. And then there's the singer \u2013 equally popular, an entertainer armed with songs ingrained in the collective unconscious and contagious (does one really need to mention Vanina, Du c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez Swann, Est-ce par hasard, or Mon c\u0153ur est malade?), an immediately identifiable voice, and exemplary longevity. His favorite playground is the stage, which he navigates while adhering to four principles firmly anchored in his volcanic being: emotion, madness, generosity, and humor.\n\nDon't expect the show to be predictable with him. Also, don't expect him to hold back on the singing. Dave is returning to the grindstone of novelty, bursting with enthusiasm! \n\nHe will give an exclusive concert in Belgium on May 31, 2024, at the Cirque Royal in Brussels!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/en\/calendar\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"it":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/fr\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"cn":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/fr\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"fr":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":"DAVE, l'interpr\u00e8te des ind\u00e9modables \u00ab Vanina \u00bb, \u00ab Du c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez Swann \u00bb et \u00ab Mon c\u0153ur est malade \u00bb sera de retour sur sc\u00e8ne pour chanter ses plus grands succ\u00e8s au Cirque Royal \u00e0 Bruxelles le 31 mai 2024 !","longdescr":"l y a l'homme. Populaire, r\u00e9cr\u00e9atif, fin gourmet, spontan\u00e9, sourire accroch\u00e9 \u00e0 son accent hollandais et bonne humeur p\u00e9taradante. Et il y a le chanteur. Populaire (bis), entertainer, arm\u00e9 de chansons inscrites dans l'inconscient collectif et contagieuses (faut-il encore vraiment citer Vanina, Du c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez Swann, Est-ce par hasard ou Mon c\u0153ur est malade ?), voix imm\u00e9diatement identifiable et long\u00e9vit\u00e9 exemplaire. Son terrain de jeu privil\u00e9gi\u00e9, c'est la sc\u00e8ne. Qu'il arpente en respectant ces quatre principes chevill\u00e9s \u00e0 son corps volcan : \u00e9motion, folie, g\u00e9n\u00e9rosit\u00e9, humour.\n\nNe pas s'attendre avec lui \u00e0 ce que le spectacle ronronne. Ne pas s'attendre, non plus, \u00e0 ce qu'il chante \u00e0 l'\u00e9conomie. Dave retourne donc au charbon de la nouveaut\u00e9 et p\u00e8te le feu ! \n\nIl donnera un concert exclusif en Belgique le 31 mai 2024 au Cirque Royal \u00e0 Bruxelles !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/fr\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"sp":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/fr\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"},"nl":{"name":"DAVE","shortdescr":"DAVE, de vertolker van onvergetelijke hits zoals \"Vanina\", \"Du c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez Swann\" en \"Mon c\u0153ur est malade\", keert op 31 mei 2024 terug naar het podium van het Koninklijk Circus in Brussel om zijn grootste successen te zingen.","longdescr":"Enerzijds heb je de mens - populair, recreatief, een fijnproever, spontaan, met de glimlach verankerd aan zijn Nederlandse accent en met een knetterend goede stemming. En dan is er de zanger - evengoed populair, een entertainer gewapend met aanstekelijke nummers die in het collectieve geheugen gegrift zijn, \u2013 moeten we echt nog Vanina, Du c\u00f4t\u00e9 de chez Swann, Est-ce par hasard of Mon c\u0153ur est Malade vermelden? \u2013 met een onmiddellijk herkenbare stem en een voorbeeldige levensloop. Zijn favoriete speelveld is het podium, dat hij bewandelt met inachtneming van de vier beginselen diep verankerd in zijn vurige persoonlijkheid: emotie, speelsheid, vrijgevigheid, en humor.\n\nVerwacht van hem geen voorspelbare show. Verwacht ook niet dat hij zich inhoudt bij het zingen. Dave keert dus terug naar de bron van zijn oeuvre, barstend van enthousiasme! \n\nHij geeft een exclusief concert in Belgi\u00eb op 31 mei 2024 in het Koninklijk Circus in Brussel!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mbpresents.be\/nl\/agenda\/dave\/65","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006369"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:16+02:00","id":329,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Circo reale","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A gest\u00e3o art\u00edstica do local, assegurada durante muito tempo pelo Jardim Bot\u00e2nico, foi atribu\u00edda \u00e0 Brussels Expo. A programa\u00e7\u00e3o musical permanecer\u00e1 o foco, embora a dan\u00e7a, o teatro e a \u00f3pera fa\u00e7am apari\u00e7\u00f5es espor\u00e1dicas na arena. Sem esquecer o circo, arte a que foi inicialmente dedicada esta sala, como o seu nome ainda recorda.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This former circus built in 1878 is probably one of the nicest venues in Brussels. The artistic management of the site, long granted by the Botanique, is in the hands of Brussels Expo now. Music programming remains the central activity, however, dance, theater or opera sometimes invest its arena too. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La gestion artistique du lieu, longtemps assur\u00e9e par le Botanique, a \u00e9t\u00e9 attribu\u00e9 \u00e0 Brussels Expo. La programmation musicale restera centrale, n\u00e9anmoins, danse, th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou op\u00e9ra investissent quelquefois son ar\u00e8ne. Sans oublier le cirque, art auquel \u00e9tait initialement d\u00e9di\u00e9e cette salle, comme le rappelle encore son nom.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Circus","address_street_name":"Onderrichtsstraat","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@koninklijkcircusbrussel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Onderrichtsstraat, 81","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het gebouw dateert van 1878, toen het dienstdeed als het enige permanente Brusselse circus. Dit voormalige circus is wellicht een van de gezelligste zalen van Brussel. Het artistieke beheer, lang in handen van de Botanique, is overgegaan naar Brussels Expo. De programmatie van concerten primeert, maar er vinden ook dansspektakels en shows plaats die gesmaakt worden door jong en oud. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":85,"locat