usic"],"it":["Musica contemporanea"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Musique Contemporaine"],"sp":["M\u00fasica contempor\u00e1nea"],"nl":["Hedendaagse Muziek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"pt":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"en":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":"Inspired by his travels and encounters, Michel Linden's songs are born of the emotion of sharing and tell stories in which everyone can identify. His album 'Aux couleurs des gens que j'aime' tells stories that are sometimes melancholy, but always tender and authentic, set to the jazz and bossa nova rhythms that fuel his inspiration and drive.","longdescr":"Michel Linden writes, composes and sings on his guitar while listening to life. Inspired by his travels and encounters, his songs are born from the emotion of sharing and tell stories everyone can relate to.\n\nHis album 'Aux couleurs des gens que j'aime' is extremely personal, full of sweetness and saudade, disarmingly spontaneous and joyful. He tells stories that are sometimes melancholic, but always tender and authentic, set to the jazz and forest rhythms that fuel his inspiration and drive.\n\nHe will perform the repertoire from this album, alongside new songs.\n\nMusic, lyrics, vocals and guitar: Michel Linden \n\nPiano and keyboard: Philippe De Cock\n\nDrums and percussion: Jean-Pierre Onraedt ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"it":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"cn":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"fr":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":"Inspir\u00e9es par les voyages et les rencontres, les chansons de Michel Linden naissent de l\u2019\u00e9motion des partages et racontent des histoires dans lesquelles chacun peut se reconna\u00eetre. Son album \u2018Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime\u2019 raconte des histoires parfois m\u00e9lancoliques, mais toujours tendres et authentiques sur les rythmes de jazz et de bossa nova qui nourrissent son inspiration et ses \u00e9lans.\n","longdescr":"Michel Linden \u00e9crit, compose et chante \u00e0 la guitare en \u00e9coutant la vie. Inspir\u00e9es par les voyages et les rencontres, ses chansons naissent de l\u2019\u00e9motion des partages et racontent des histoires dans lesquelles chacun peut se reconna\u00eetre.\n\nSon album \u2018Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime\u2019 est extr\u00eamement personnel, empreint de douceur et de saudade, d\u2019une spontan\u00e9it\u00e9 d\u00e9sarmante et heureuse. Il y raconte des histoires parfois m\u00e9lancoliques, mais toujours tendres et authentiques sur les rythmes de jazz et de bossa qui nourrissent son inspiration et ses \u00e9lans.\n\nIl interpr\u00e9tera le r\u00e9pertoire de cet album, mais \u00e9galement en primeur de nouvelles chansons.\n\nMusique, paroles, voix et guitare : Michel Linden \n\nPiano et clavier : Philippe De Cock\n\nBatterie et percussions : Jean-Pierre Onraedt \n\n","performers":"Musique, paroles, voix et guitare : Michel Linden \nPiano et clavier : Philippe De Cock\nBatterie et percussions : Jean-Pierre Onraedt ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"sp":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"},"nl":{"name":"Aux couleurs des gens que j\u2019aime- Michel Linden","shortdescr":"Ge\u00efnspireerd door zijn reizen en ontmoetingen, zijn de liedjes van Michel Linden geboren uit de emotie van het delen en vertellen ze verhalen waarin iedereen zich kan herkennen. Zijn album 'Aux couleurs des gens que j'aime' vertelt verhalen die soms melancholisch zijn, maar altijd teder en authentiek, op de jazz en bossa nova ritmes die zijn inspiratie en drive voeden.","longdescr":"Michel Linden schrijft, componeert en zingt op zijn gitaar terwijl hij luistert naar het leven. Ge\u00efnspireerd door zijn reizen en ontmoetingen worden zijn liedjes geboren uit de emotie van het delen en vertellen ze verhalen waarin iedereen zich kan herkennen.\n\nZijn album 'Aux couleurs des gens que j'aime' is extreem persoonlijk, vol zoetheid en saudade, ontwapenend spontaan en vrolijk. Hij vertelt verhalen die soms melancholisch zijn, maar altijd teder en authentiek, op de jazz- en bossaritmes die zijn inspiratie en drive voeden.\n\nHij zal het repertoire van dit album ten gehore brengen, naast nieuwe nummers.\n\nMuziek, tekst, zang en gitaar: Michel Linden \n\nPiano en keyboard: Philippe De Cock\n\nDrums en percussie : Jean-Pierre Onraedt ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.com\/","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010829"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2023-10-09T09:15:47+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-15T20:19:31+02:00","id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"in