D vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"pt":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"en":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"it":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"cn":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"fr":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"BYD est un jeune peintre belge n\u00e9 \u00e0 Addis-Abeba, en \u00c9thiopie, mais qui a grandi \u00e0 Bruxelles. Depuis son enfance, BYD entretient un lien profond avec sa culture d\u2019origine et souhaite s\u2019en rapprocher. Son inspiration premi\u00e8re r\u00e9side dans l\u2019alphabet amharique utilis\u00e9 dans l\u2019\u00e9criture \u00e9thiopienne. Il affectionne particuli\u00e8rement sa calligraphie \u00e9l\u00e9gante et singuli\u00e8re. \u00c0 travers son art, il r\u00e9invente cet alphabet, cr\u00e9ant ainsi un langage artistique qui lui est propre. Par ailleurs, BYD s\u2019inspire des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui animent son quotidien et les interpr\u00e8te \u00e0 sa fa\u00e7on. De toile en toile, il exprime \u00e9galement sa passion pour la couleur, utilisant celle-ci pour mettre en lumi\u00e8re les \u00e9motions qui le traversent et qu\u2019il ne peut exprimer par les mots.","performers":"Intervenant: BYD","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"sp":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"},"nl":{"name":"BYD vernissage","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onlyonebyd\/?locale=kk-KZ","email":"baoyaried@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 59 26 10","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010830"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2024-05-16T09:51:42+02:00","published_at":"2024-05-16T09:51:42+02:00","id":50001737,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arcane","address_street_name":"Rue Vanderkindere","address_street_number":"336","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","