","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010877"},"it":{"name":"The Ghost of Yourself - Claude Cattelain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wolubilis.be\/a-voir\/the-ghost-of-yourself\/","email":"info@wolubilis.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 29","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010877"},"cn":{"name":"The Ghost of Yourself - Claude Cattelain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wolubilis.be\/a-voir\/the-ghost-of-yourself\/","email":"info@wolubilis.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 29","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010877"},"fr":{"name":"The Ghost of Yourself - Claude Cattelain","shortdescr":"Pour les Monographies ARTS+, et sur l\u2019invitation du Centre culturel Wolubilis, Claude Cattelain investit l\u2019espace atypique de la M\u00e9diatine, b\u00e2timent en briques rouges nich\u00e9 au milieu des arbres. Sa proposition plastique, intitul\u00e9e The Ghost of Yourself, con\u00e7ue comme un parcours \u00e0 exp\u00e9rimenter, bouleverse la lecture de l\u2019espace et brouille la fronti\u00e8re entre spectateur\u00b7rice et performeur\u00b7euse. ","longdescr":"Pour les Monographies ARTS+, et sur l\u2019invitation du Centre culturel Wolubilis, Claude Cattelain investit l\u2019espace atypique de la M\u00e9diatine, b\u00e2timent en briques rouges nich\u00e9 au milieu des arbres. Sa proposition plastique, intitul\u00e9e The Ghost of Yourself, con\u00e7ue comme un parcours \u00e0 exp\u00e9rimenter, bouleverse la lecture de l\u2019espace et brouille la fronti\u00e8re entre spectateur\u00b7rice et performeur\u00b7euse. Comme \u00e0 son habitude, tout est r\u00e9alis\u00e9 in situ, cr\u00e9ant un dialogue intime avec l\u2019architecture du lieu, tel un \u00e9cho du pass\u00e9 au pr\u00e9sent.\n\nSi Claude Cattelain s\u2019est d\u2019abord int\u00e9ress\u00e9 \u00e0 la peinture, il s\u2019en est rapidement d\u00e9tach\u00e9 pour se tourner vers la vid\u00e9o, la performance, la sculpture, le dessin et l\u2019installation. De sa pratique picturale subsiste un sens aigu de la composition, notamment dans ses impressionnantes sculptures, form\u00e9es de planches r\u00e9cup\u00e9r\u00e9es, autoportantes et maintenues ensemble par des serre-joints ou des barres d\u2019acier. Pla\u00e7ant son corps au centre de sa pratique, \u00e0 la fois comme le r\u00e9ceptacle et l\u2019instigateur de son \u0153uvre, il l\u2019\u00e9prouve et le pousse dans ses retranchements, flirtant avec ses limites.\n\nTenir debout, au sens propre comme au sens figur\u00e9, est une pr\u00e9occupation centrale dans sa d\u00e9marche. Sculptures en \u00e9quilibre, constructions instables, structures sous tension tentent de d\u00e9fier les lois de la gravit\u00e9, pr\u00eates \u00e0 chuter. Dans un monde mouvant, inquiet, impr\u00e9visible, il s\u2019agit d\u2019accepter aussi l\u2019accident, l\u2019effondrement, y faire face, reconstruire et recommencer.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wolubilis.be\/a-voir\/the-ghost-of-yourself\/","email":"info@wolubilis.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 29","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010877"},"sp":{"name":"The Ghost of Yourself - Claude Cattelain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wolubilis.be\/a-voir\/the-ghost-of-yourself\/","email":"info@wolubilis.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 29","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010877"},"nl":{"name":"The Ghost of Yourself - Claude Cattelain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.wolubilis.be\/a-voir\/the-ghost-of-yourself\/","email":"info@wolubilis.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 29","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010877"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-18T11:25:22+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:39+02:00","id":220532,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 29","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak, 1","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 29","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak, 1","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","website":"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ateliersdutempslibre","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 29","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak, 1","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_u