n \n\nContact us at contact@macadamgallery.com to receive the artist's new catalogue of available works.\n","performers":"Jordan Tran  \/ Kean (France, 1988)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/exhibitions\/25-aurore-celeste-a-new-installation-exhibition-by-kean\/","email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 489 11 96 21","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010997"},"it":{"name":"Aurore C\u00e9leste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/exhibitions\/25-aurore-celeste-a-new-installation-exhibition-by-kean\/","email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 489 11 96 21","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010997"},"cn":{"name":"Aurore C\u00e9leste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/exhibitions\/25-aurore-celeste-a-new-installation-exhibition-by-kean\/","email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 489 11 96 21","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010997"},"fr":{"name":"Aurore C\u00e9leste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/exhibitions\/25-aurore-celeste-a-new-installation-exhibition-by-kean\/","email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 489 11 96 21","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010997"},"sp":{"name":"Aurore C\u00e9leste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/exhibitions\/25-aurore-celeste-a-new-installation-exhibition-by-kean\/","email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 489 11 96 21","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010997"},"nl":{"name":"Aurore C\u00e9leste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/exhibitions\/25-aurore-celeste-a-new-installation-exhibition-by-kean\/","email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 489 11 96 21","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010997"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2024-05-23T14:47:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:55:04+02:00","id":252729,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Macadam Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue du Charme","address_street_number":"34","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Rue du Charme, 34","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Macadam Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue du Charme","address_street_number":"34","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Rue du Charme, 34","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Macadam Gallery","address_street_name":"Steenbeukstraat","address_street_number":"34","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Steenbeukstraat, 34","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Since 2012, Macadam Gallery has committed to defend artists whose research revolves around architectural language, mediums and perspective. Macadam is a promise of innovative creation in both content and form. Its artist crew works towards the visual experience and are committed to share a new way of seeing and perceiving. The dialogues between the gallery's emerging and established artists reflect Macadam's commitment to promote a vision of true art that is open to the world.\nMacadam Gallery presents and promotes to its collectors works by Invader, Thomas Devaux, Johan van Mullem, Oli-B, David Mesguich, Jan Kal\u00e1b, Andrzej Urbanski, Daniel Mirchev, Emeric Chantier, \u00c5sa Johansson, Jaime Poblete, David Moreno, Fran\u00e7ois Bonnel, Sali Muller, Tomislav Topi\u0107, Esma\u00ebl Bahrani, James Austin Murray, Katy Ann Gilmore, RODA and more.\nAfter more than ten years in the Marolles, this 2024 Macadam continues its art journey in a new location: Rue du Charme 34, 1190 Forest, Brussels.\nLike the art that it represents, Macadam reinvents itself, changes its skin, and opens its doors in a new space where there will be exciting exhibitions, events and artist residencies. The team is thrilled and proud to welcome you into a new space dedicated to the promotion of sensibility and contemporary Belgian and international art. \n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Macadam Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue du Charme","address_street_number":"34","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@macadamgallery.com","website":"https:\/\/www.macadamgallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Rue du Charme, 34","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Macadam Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue du Charme","address_str