{"id":50008882,"date_start":"2024-04-02","date_end":"2024-12-31","date_next":"2024-05-27","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-05-27T02:01:01+02:00","published_at":"2024-04-02T10:56:07+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":297313,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"tour","ranking":0.15396304049941917,"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","pt":null,"en":"Guided tours","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[108],"translations":{"de":["Folklore"],"pt":[null],"en":["Folklore"],"it":["Folklore"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Folklore"],"sp":["Folclore"],"nl":["Folklore"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"pt":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"en":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Once upon a time there was a bakery that became the House of the King and eventually turned into a museum. Its lacy fa\u00e7ade hides architectural secrets, symbols of the city\u2019s history and the presence of the Duke. Inside are models, statues in bronze and wood, old stones, altarpieces and paintings that reveal themselves to the most determined visitor. When the House of the King speaks of history, the past and neighbourhoods of Brussels shine in a different and bri- ghter light. It really does have some surprises in store!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"it":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"cn":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"fr":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Il \u00e9tait une fois une halle au pain qui devenue maison du Roi s'est m\u00e9tamorphos\u00e9e en mus\u00e9e. Une fa\u00e7ade de dentelles cache des secrets d'architecture, des symboles de l'histoire de la ville, de la pr\u00e9sence ducale. A l'int\u00e9rieur, des maquettes, des statues en bronze, en bois, des vieilles pierres, des retables, des peintures qui se d\u00e9voilent au visiteur plus acharn\u00e9. Quand  la maison du Roi parle d'elle, l'histoire, les quartiers de Bruxelles s'\u00e9clairent et se montrent autrement. Des surprises, elle en abrite! \n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"sp":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00c9rase una vez una panader\u00eda que se convirti\u00f3 en casa de rey y luego en museo, con una fachada de encaje que esconde secretos arquitect\u00f3nicos, s\u00edmbolos de la historia de la ciudad y restos de la presencia ducal. El visitante m\u00e1s perseverante podr\u00e1 maravillarse con maquetas, estatuas de bronce y madera, piedras antiguas, retablos y pinturas que se exponen en su interior. Cuando se empieza a conocer la historia de la Maison du Roi, los barrios de Bruselas ya no se guardan ning\u00fan secreto y se empiezan a percibir de otra manera. \u00a1Est\u00e1n llenos de sorpresas!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"},"nl":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance: focus sur la Maison du Roi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Er was eens een broodhal waar de koning zijn intrek nam en die uitgroeide tot het museum van de stad. Achter de gevel, een kantwerk in steen, gaan architecturale geheimen, geschiedkundige symbolen en sporen van een hertogelijk hof schuil. Binnen kunnen geboeide bezoekers tal van maquettes, bronzen en houten beel- den, oude stenen, retabels en schilderijen bewonderen. Als het Broodhuis van zich laat spreken, licht de geschiedenis op en tonen de wijken van Brussel zich van een andere kant. Het pand heeft heel wat verrassende hoekjes!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.itineraires.be\/","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008882"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2021-08-20T16:04:47+02:00","published_at":"2015-03-07T17:08:44+01:00","id":260203,"translations":{"de":{"name":"H\u00f4tel de Ville de Bruxelles, Escalier des Lions","address_street_name":"Grand-Place de Bruxelles","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Grand-Place de Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"H\u00f4tel de Ville de Bruxelles, Escalier des Lions","address_street_name":"Grand-Place de Bruxelles","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Grand-Place de Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"H\u00f4tel de Ville, Escalier des Lions","address_street_name":"Grand-Place de Bruxelles","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grand-Place de Bruxelles","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking