":"expo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/charliermuseum.be","email":"info@charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010974"},"fr":{"name":"Autres & Ensemble","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"L\u2019exposition \"Autres & Ensemble\" sera inaugur\u00e9e au Mus\u00e9e Charlier !\n\n\u00c0 travers l\u2019art et la culture, les \u00e9l\u00e8ves du Lyc\u00e9e Guy Cudell explorent les questions de genre dans l\u2019histoire coloniale. Leur exposition encourage une r\u00e9flexion critique sur le f\u00e9minisme occidental et les pr\u00e9occupations des femmes du cinqui\u00e8me si\u00e8cle jusqu\u2019\u00e0 nos jours.\nL\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nement sera accompagn\u00e9 d\u2019une prestation du slameur Youness Mernissi","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/charliermuseum.be","email":"info@charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010974"},"sp":{"name":"expo","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/charliermuseum.be","email":"info@charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010974"},"nl":{"name":"Autres & Ensemble","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De tentoonstelling \"Anderen & Samen\" wordt ingehuldigd in het Charlier Museum!\n\nVia kunst en cultuur verkennen de leerlingen van het Guy Cudell Lyceum genderkwesties in de koloniale geschiedenis. Hun tentoonstelling zet aan tot kritisch nadenken over het westerse feminisme en de bezorgdheden van vrouwen van de vijfde eeuw tot vandaag.\nTijdens het evenement zal er tevens een optreden plaatsvinden van de slammer Youness Mernissi.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/charliermuseum.be","email":"info@charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010974"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2024-01-25T14:18:44+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","id":753,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Das 1928 eingeweihte Museum ist wie ein Gem\u00e4lde der Epoche... man findet sich in der Zeit der La Libre Est\u00e9tique und der Groupe des 20 wieder. Die Sammlungen werden in den reich mit Mobiliar und historischen Dekorationsgegenst\u00e4nden (Louis XV, Louis XV und Empire) best\u00fcckten Salons ausgestellt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Charlier Museum","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The museum is based in the private mansion, dating from the 19th century, of the sculptor Guillaume Charlier. It focuses on Belgian painting from the late 19th to the early 20th century. Its art exhibitions take place in a setting of lavish furnishings, with numerous decorative pieces from the Louis XV, Louis XVI, and Empire periods.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le mus\u00e9e, inaugur\u00e9 en 1928, est comme un tableau d\u2019\u00e9poque\u2026 on se retrouve au temps de La Libre Esth\u00e9tique et du Groupe des 20. Les collections sont expos\u00e9es dans les salons, riches en mobilier et objets d\u2019art d\u00e9coratifs d\u2019\u00e9poque Louis XV, Louis XVI et Empire.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"El Museo Charlier, una mansi\u00f3n del siglo XIX obra de Horta durante sus a\u00f1os de juventud, te sumergir\u00e1 en la atm\u00f3sfera de un lujoso sal\u00f3n de arte: la Belle Epoque te invita a so\u00f1ar, a pasear entre las esculturas de Charlier, Hager y Wouters, las pinturas de Smits, Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric, Oleffe, Laermans, Van Strydonck, Ensor... Este ambiente \u00edntimo se completa con los muebles de los ebanistas Chapuis, Sen\u00e9, Nadal l'A\u00een\u00e9, numerosos objetos de arte decorativo de estilos Luis XIV, XV, XVI y estilo Imperio, tapices de Bruselas y Audenaerde, as\u00ed como excepcionales un excepcional sal\u00f3n chino. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Charliermuseum","address_street_name":"Kunstlaan","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Kunstlaan, 16","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"Het museum, geopend in 1928, is gevestigd in het prive-herenhuis van de beeldhouwer Guillaume Charlier, dat dateert uit de 19e eeuw. Het richt zich op de Belgische schilderkunst van eind 19e tot begin 20e eeuw. De collecties worden getoond in de salons, rijkelijk voorzien van decoratieve stukken uit de Louis XV, Louis XVI en Empire periodes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":152,"location":{"lat":50.84755959,"lon":4.36997724},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2021-08-22T04:13:22+02:00","published_at":"2021-05-28T14:34:54+02:00","id":276597,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Commune de Saint-Josse-ten-Noode","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Commune de Saint-Josse-ten-Noode","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Commune de Saint-Josse-ten-Noode","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_l