obe; from the established to emerging and unrepresented (yet) by galleries. As the guide to her guests(in a reduced number), Galila through her collection promotes the exchange and sharing of her vision and passions, taking us out of our daily routines! Galila\u2019s P.O.C. strives to be a space free from all prejudices and open to the world. Private visits are only under reservation and the program varies, please check the website for more details.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 295","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 295","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 295","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":"Au travers d\u2019une vingtaine de th\u00e9matiques \u00e9clectiques et non d\u00e9nu\u00e9es d\u2019humour (telles que l\u2019\u0153il, le livre, la chaise ou le recyclage), Galilas\u2019 P.O.C. pr\u00e9sente un \u00e9ventail extravagant et percutant d'artistes ultra-contemporains venus des quatre coins du globe; d\u2019artistes \u00e9tablis \u00e0 d\u2019autres n\u2019\u00e9tant pas (encore) repr\u00e9sent\u00e9s par des galeries.\r\nEn faisant le choix de guider les visites (en nombre r\u00e9duit) elle-m\u00eame, Galila souhaite ainsi favoriser l'\u00e9change, partager sa passion avec les visiteurs et nous faire sortir de notre quotidien ! Galila\u2019s P.O.C. se veut \u00eatre un lieu libre de tout pr\u00e9jug\u00e9 et ouvert sur le monde.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Galila's","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 295","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Van Volxemlaan","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Vorst","address_line1":"Van Volxemlaan, 295","address_line2":"1190 Vorst","description_web":"Door middel van meer dan twintig humoristische en eclectische thema\u2019s (zoals het oog, het boek, de stoel of recyclage) presenteert Galila\u2019s P.O.C. een extravagante en treffende selectie aan ultra-hedendaagse kunstenaars uit alle uithoeken van de wereld; van gevestigde waarden tot jonge kunstenaars die nog niet vertegenwoordigd zijn door een galerij.\r\nDoor de bezoeken in kleine groepen persoonlijk te begeleiden, hoopt Galila een atmosfeer van verbinding en uitwisseling op te wekken, haar passie met de bezoekers te delen en ons voor even uit onze dagelijkse routine te halen. Galila\u2019s P.O.C. streeft ernaar een plaats te zijn vrij van vooroordelen en open naar de wereld.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":35627,"location":{"lat":50.82266409,"lon":4.32629443},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2024-02-14T10:35:15+01:00","published_at":"2020-07-08T12:36:57+02:00","id":275627,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 295","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Galila's P.O.C.","address_street_name":"Avenue Van Volxem","address_street_number":"295","address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@galilaspoc.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galilaspoc.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 63 66 12","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1190","address_city":"Forest","address_line1":"Avenue Van Volxem, 295","address_line2":"1190 Forest","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_vi