g\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/7430f3e4931aef4ef220f6991d6231cc7e3f1065.jpg","width":3674,"height":5503,"ratio":0.67,"oEmbed_height":5503,"oEmbed_width":3674,"translations":{"de":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"brunch","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2024-01-28","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"14:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2024-02-04","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"14:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2024-02-11","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"14:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2024-02-18","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"14:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2024-02-25","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"14:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"i